  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ram ɔ kap ɣa̱c raam in dɔ̱ŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mäthnikä, mi ca raan käp kä yɛ a lätdɛ duer, kä yɛn nɛy tin ca Yiëë jek, gɔaa ni ɣöö deri ram ɛmɔ luɔ̱ɔ̱c duundɛ ɣöö kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p yieekä wutdä. Niɛkɛ rɔ kɛ ɣöö /ca yɛ bi ɣɔam bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ramɔ kap ɣa̱c raam in dɔ̱diɛn, kɛ jɛn duɔ̱ɔ̱p ɛmɔ bia la̱t ni ŋut Kritho kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö mi caar ram mi thil ŋu ɛn ɣöö ŋäcɛ ŋu kaŋɛ ni rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a ramɔ ɣɔ̱n la̱tdɛ kä a rɔ /cɛ cäät kɛ lät raadɔ̱diɛn. Kä jɛn ba duɔ̱ɔ̱p mi duŋ liakä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bi ramɔ dhil kap ni ɣa̱cdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn nɛy tin ca ŋi̱eec kɛ ruac ŋäthä, akɛ nyuak ŋɔak diaal ti gɔw kɛ ram in ŋi̱eeckɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A yɛ /ca kaŋ. Kä /ca Kuoth dee kaŋ, kɛ ɣöö bi ŋɛr ni min ci pith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ram mi pi̱th kɛ kui̱ ri̱eŋdɛ bɛ ŋɛr ni da̱k kä ri̱ŋ. Kä ram mi pi̱th kɛ kui̱ Yieekä bɛ tëk mi do̱raar ŋɛr kä Yiëë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cuarɛ cuc kɛ lätni kä ti gɔw, kɛ ɣöö banɛ ŋɛɛr gua̱a̱th ŋer, mi /ci kɔn rɔ̱ luär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, mi ta̱nɛ kɛ gua̱a̱th la̱tnɛ gɔɔyä nɛɛni diaal, kä la̱tnɛ ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni tin la ji̱ thuɔk duëël ŋäthä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lui̱k in jɔak kɛnɛ ner",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛ̈nɛ rieetkä ti dhök dhöök tin gɔ̱a̱rä yɛ kɛ tetdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn nɛy tin görkɛ ɣöö bikɛ nyuuth mi gɔaa la̱t rɛy pua̱a̱ny, kɛn tin kuk yɛ ɣöö ba yɛ cuɛl, kä lätkɛ inɔ, kɛ ɣöö /ca kɛ bi ciɛŋ a jiäk kɛ kui̱ jiaath ŋäpä Kritho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cäŋɛ kɛn nɛy tin ca cuɛl /cikɛ ŋuɔ̱t guur, kä görkɛ ɣöö ba yɛ cuɛl kɛ ɣöö dee kɛ rɔ̱ liak kɛ pua̱nykun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a rɔ /cä liak kɛ min ce̱tkɛ ɛnɔ, kɛ ɣöö liakä ni jiath ëë li̱w Kuääran ni Yecu Kritho thi̱n kärɔa. Kɛ kui̱dɛ ci ɣɔw li̱w kä ɣä, kä ci ɣän li̱w kä ɣɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuël kɛnɛ thil cuelä /ciɛ kɛn tekɛ luɔt ɔ, ɛ jɛn mi pay cak ɛ Yiëë Kuɔth tekɛ luɔt ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mal kɛnɛ kɔ̱a̱c lɔaac tekɛ nɛy diaal tin guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ ŋut mɛmɛ. Kä a jɛ te kɛɛl kɛ nɛɛ Kuɔth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A tɛmɛ ni ɛn täämɛ a thil ram mi jut ɣä, kɛ ɣöö te puɔ̱nydä kɛ pia̱ri kɛ kui̱ Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A puɔ̱th Kua̱ran ni Yecu Kritho te kɛɛl kɛ yiëëdun, gaatmaari. Inɔnɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
